{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-amara-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"amara-villas","about":"Developed by Majid Al Futtaim, Amara Twin Villas is located in Tilal Al Ghaf, a community offering resort-style living. Inspired by the graceful curves of desert dunes and lush wadis, Amara Twin Villas is perched on a stunning hilly terrain. The 3 to 5-bedroom villas have a covered area ranging from 1317 sq. ft. to 1916 sq. ft. Integrating nature into the living spaces, semi-outdoor areas in the stunning residences feature lush greenery, with one side overlooking the community park and the other side opening up to the public realm. Residents can enjoy countless activities within the community, including padel, basketball, yoga, or simply lounging by the beach. Situated at the heart of Tilal Al Ghaf, Amara provides easy access to the beach, retail shops, and dining spots that are just steps away from your doorstep.","price":null,"title":"Amara Villas","bitrix":{"id":319,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Amara Villas","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Amara Villas","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Majid Al Futtaim","project_location":"Tilal Al Ghaf"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/amara_feature_3da014f219.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/amara_feature_3da014f219.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0254441,"lng":55.2243809},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/amara_1_52bdc1b30a.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/amara_1_52bdc1b30a.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/amara_2_d0b174f4f7.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/amara_2_d0b174f4f7.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/amara_3_d4c5f85a1b.webp","464x31